<title>USA: JC Penney says Associates to buy portfolio.</title>
<headline>JC Penney says Associates to buy portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Penney Co Inc said Tuesday that Associates National Bank of Delaware, a subsidiary of Associates First Capital Corp, agreed to buy the $740 million bank credit card portfolio from JCPenney National Bank of Harrington.</p>
</text>
